From: Chen-Yu Tsai <wens@kernel.org>
Subject: [PATCH] media: cedrus: add H616 video-engine compatible

Backport of the upstream H616 Cedrus support.
The H616 video engine reuses the existing H6 Cedrus variant data.

Upstream: [PATCH v3 4/7] staging: media: sunxi: cedrus: add H616 variant
Link: https://patchew.org/linux/20260712030011.3778169-1-wens%40kernel.org/20260712030011.3778169-5-wens%40kernel.org/

Reviewed-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Chen-Yu Tsai <wens@kernel.org>

--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -696,6 +696,10 @@
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h6-video-engine",
 		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine",
+		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
+	},
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, cedrus_dt_match);
